WEBVTT

00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:54.070
Pirates!

00:01:54.530 --> 00:01:55.940
We're under attack!

00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:23.760
Hold them off! Get down on the floor.

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:53.170
Tear gas!

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:07.060
What are you waiting for? Break it down!

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:17.320
Where'd she go?

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:20.400
There she is!

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:23.240
She's getting away!

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:26.530
Well, get her!

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:29.290
Mama, don't drop me!

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:33.830
There's the stone. Quick, go next door!

00:03:34.170 --> 00:03:36.170
Get that crystal!

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:46.760
There goes the crystal.

00:06:27.470 --> 00:06:29.680
Two meatballs, please.

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:31.470
Working late?

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:33.890
We're finally busy again.

00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:36.470
-Still working?
-Yeah.

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:48.570
What's that?

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:57.660
A person!

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:52.590
Pazu!

00:07:53.130 --> 00:07:56.930
What are you up to? Where's my dinner?

00:07:57.010 --> 00:07:58.180
Boss!

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:00.640
A girl fell from the sky.

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:22.540
Boss, she fell from the sky.

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:27.840
Darn old clunker.

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:29.920
Boss! A girl...

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:32.340
Close valve number two!

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:45.060
-Pazu, toss me a wrench.
-Sure.

00:08:49.230 --> 00:08:50.860
I'm busy here. You take it.

00:08:51.610 --> 00:08:53.900
-Don't make them wait.
-Yes!

00:08:56.410 --> 00:08:58.990
-Keep a steady hand.
-Yes!

00:09:16.090 --> 00:09:17.090
Brake!

00:09:29.770 --> 00:09:30.650
Any luck?

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:33.070
No silver, no tin even.

00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:35.740
All that wasted work.

00:09:35.820 --> 00:09:38.070
Should we try the east vein?

00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:40.950
That's riddled with old holes.

00:09:41.030 --> 00:09:43.080
We'll have to start over.

00:09:43.950 --> 00:09:45.250
That's enough for today.

00:09:48.460 --> 00:09:49.670
Push!

00:09:58.260 --> 00:10:00.930
Shut down the boiler. Call it a day.

00:10:01.010 --> 00:10:02.680
I'll go under at this rate.

00:10:07.480 --> 00:10:10.400
Oil the clunker, Pazu.

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:11.560
Yes!

00:10:26.660 --> 00:10:30.500
Mama, we couldn't find her. It's too dark.

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:32.290
I hope you really looked!

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:35.880
All right. We'll wait for daylight.

00:13:16.170 --> 00:13:17.790
Hi. How are you feeling?

00:13:18.210 --> 00:13:20.380
Hey, come on guys...

00:13:27.050 --> 00:13:30.390
I'm Pazu. I live here by myself.

00:13:31.350 --> 00:13:32.770
They eat after I play.

00:13:43.190 --> 00:13:45.950
So you are human after all.

00:13:46.320 --> 00:13:49.110
I was afraid you were an angel.

00:13:49.820 --> 00:13:51.700
Thanks for helping me.

00:13:52.240 --> 00:13:53.620
I'm Sheeta.

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:56.120
Sheeta, nice name.

00:13:56.210 --> 00:13:58.370
You fell from the sky. A bit scary.

00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:02.800
That's right. Why am I still alive?

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:05.130
I fell from the airship...

00:14:05.710 --> 00:14:08.010
-Have you forgotten?
-Yes.

00:14:13.760 --> 00:14:15.310
Say, can I see that?

00:14:16.850 --> 00:14:18.100
-This?
-Yes.

00:14:21.230 --> 00:14:23.820
It's been in my family forever.

00:14:25.230 --> 00:14:26.530
It's beautiful.

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:27.990
Wait...

00:14:39.460 --> 00:14:40.580
Watch this!

00:14:45.960 --> 00:14:47.090
Pazu!

00:15:03.230 --> 00:15:05.650
So it wasn't the stone after all.

00:15:22.120 --> 00:15:23.380
Pazu!

00:15:28.630 --> 00:15:29.510
Oh, no! Pazu!

00:15:32.430 --> 00:15:34.510
-Are you okay?
-Yeah. Are you?

00:15:34.600 --> 00:15:36.720
I'm fine. Sorry, did it hurt?

00:15:36.810 --> 00:15:40.140
No, my head's harder than my boss's fists.

00:15:46.690 --> 00:15:48.690
The pot's still boiling.

00:15:48.780 --> 00:15:50.360
Hungry? Let's eat.

00:15:50.860 --> 00:15:52.360
Wash up over there.

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:57.530
-There's a towel.
-Thank you.

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:17.430
Laputa...

00:16:21.560 --> 00:16:24.350
Sheeta! Where are you?

00:16:33.820 --> 00:16:36.280
My father took that picture.

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:39.280
That's Laputa, an island in the sky.

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:41.500
An island in the sky?

00:16:41.580 --> 00:16:43.540
They say it's only a myth.

00:16:44.710 --> 00:16:46.290
But my father saw it.

00:17:24.580 --> 00:17:26.330
He took it from an airship.

00:17:26.960 --> 00:17:31.550
There's a Laputa in <i>Gulliver's Travels</i>,
but Swift made it up.

00:17:31.630 --> 00:17:33.840
Dad drew this.

00:17:34.720 --> 00:17:39.010
He said the abandoned palace
was full of treasure.

00:17:39.640 --> 00:17:41.470
But nobody believed him.

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:46.480
Until he died, they called him a liar.

00:17:52.650 --> 00:17:55.190
But my father never lied.

00:17:56.110 --> 00:18:00.280
I'm building a real plane.
I'm going to find Laputa!

00:18:11.340 --> 00:18:13.840
A real automobile...

00:18:13.920 --> 00:18:15.510
They're pirates!

00:18:16.670 --> 00:18:18.550
They attacked the airship.

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:21.550
-Are they after you?
-Yes.

00:18:21.640 --> 00:18:22.550
Quick!

00:18:29.020 --> 00:18:30.940
-Morning!
-Hey, wait!

00:18:32.310 --> 00:18:33.820
We're in a rush.

00:18:34.440 --> 00:18:36.280
Have you seen a girl?

00:18:37.110 --> 00:18:40.280
Sure, yesterday...
The boss's kid, Madge...

00:18:41.370 --> 00:18:42.530
Off you go!

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:47.790
They're looking for you.

00:18:48.870 --> 00:18:50.750
Louis, a girl's dress!

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:54.170
What! She was disguised! Tell Mama!

00:18:54.250 --> 00:18:55.090
All right!

00:19:02.050 --> 00:19:03.510
Haven't seen her.

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:06.680
A cute little girl. Brown hair, braids...

00:19:06.770 --> 00:19:08.020
Boss!

00:19:08.600 --> 00:19:09.890
Boss!

00:19:11.690 --> 00:19:13.480
About that age.

00:19:17.480 --> 00:19:18.780
Hey!

00:19:19.110 --> 00:19:20.320
That's her!

00:19:24.370 --> 00:19:26.740
Pirates! They're chasing her.

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:32.670
Pirates! Lemme see!

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:36.090
Not one step closer.

00:19:37.300 --> 00:19:38.590
Hand her over.

00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:40.630
-Pirates, eh?
-Dola's clan.

00:19:40.720 --> 00:19:43.640
Go home. Just poor folk here.

00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:46.850
-Ma'am?
-Scoot out the back.

00:19:46.930 --> 00:19:48.100
I want to fight.

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:50.640
-They've got weapons!
-But...

00:19:52.270 --> 00:19:53.810
What a pretty girl. Better protect her.

00:19:57.650 --> 00:19:59.440
You refuse to step aside?

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:01.400
Use your fists.

00:20:01.490 --> 00:20:02.910
Could be interesting.

00:20:04.280 --> 00:20:05.740
Get him, brother.

00:20:17.840 --> 00:20:20.340
Show your stuff.

00:20:28.470 --> 00:20:29.890
Wow.

00:20:32.640 --> 00:20:34.650
Who's going to mend that shirt?

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:54.790
You can beat him!

00:21:01.920 --> 00:21:03.760
That's it, hit him!

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:08.180
Off you go!

00:21:30.120 --> 00:21:33.370
Think you can fool me? After them!

00:21:41.880 --> 00:21:42.880
Climb on!

00:21:46.380 --> 00:21:47.430
There you go.

00:21:49.390 --> 00:21:51.600
Playing hooky for a date?

00:21:51.680 --> 00:21:53.220
Bad guys are after us.

00:21:57.020 --> 00:21:59.480
-The Dola clan.
-Pirates?

00:21:59.560 --> 00:22:01.440
Take us to the next town. To the police!

00:22:01.520 --> 00:22:03.530
You're on. Stoke the fire.

00:22:03.610 --> 00:22:04.570
Okay.

00:22:10.990 --> 00:22:12.200
Mama!

00:22:15.250 --> 00:22:17.960
You idiots! Hurry up and get on!

00:22:18.210 --> 00:22:20.460
What? But the girl's...

00:22:20.790 --> 00:22:23.340
She slipped out the back door. Get moving!

00:22:24.130 --> 00:22:25.550
Brother!

00:22:26.090 --> 00:22:27.420
Wait!

00:22:54.200 --> 00:22:56.290
They're catching up, more steam!

00:22:57.500 --> 00:22:59.330
Can't you go any faster?

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:01.630
She's an old-timer.

00:23:04.800 --> 00:23:07.210
-Move over!
-Whoa!

00:23:15.470 --> 00:23:17.560
Mama, I can't hang on!

00:23:32.490 --> 00:23:35.030
More steam, they're gaining on us!

00:23:37.620 --> 00:23:39.120
Here we go!

00:23:39.960 --> 00:23:41.160
Sheeta, over here.

00:23:43.290 --> 00:23:45.000
-Stoke the fire.
-Okay!

00:23:55.510 --> 00:23:57.680
Don't give up!

00:24:04.810 --> 00:24:06.820
Push! Push, I tell you!

00:24:18.540 --> 00:24:20.200
Not so fast!

00:24:24.880 --> 00:24:26.540
Don't let them escape!

00:24:26.630 --> 00:24:29.210
Dump this over the side!

00:24:32.420 --> 00:24:34.970
-That'll teach them!
-I'll do it.

00:24:35.050 --> 00:24:36.340
No, let me.

00:24:39.140 --> 00:24:42.560
Up we go! Up we go!

00:24:42.640 --> 00:24:43.770
Wait!

00:24:48.650 --> 00:24:50.360
It's them. What'll we do?

00:24:50.440 --> 00:24:52.780
I refuse to give up. Move!

00:25:07.790 --> 00:25:11.050
This is a surprise. If it isn't the army!

00:25:16.930 --> 00:25:22.140
These kids need help!
They've got pirates after them.

00:25:32.940 --> 00:25:34.030
Sheeta?

00:25:34.860 --> 00:25:37.450
Goodbye. Wait!

00:25:40.030 --> 00:25:41.660
Sheeta!

00:25:42.450 --> 00:25:43.910
Halt or I'll shoot.

00:25:49.790 --> 00:25:51.040
An armored train.

00:25:51.130 --> 00:25:52.710
Who cares! Ram it!

00:25:55.300 --> 00:25:57.180
What is it, Sheeta!

00:25:57.680 --> 00:25:58.930
Stay away!

00:26:40.390 --> 00:26:41.470
They're gonna fall!

00:26:41.550 --> 00:26:44.010
Quiet. Watch closely.

00:27:08.870 --> 00:27:09.910
We're floating!

00:27:16.460 --> 00:27:18.630
Look! It's that crystal!

00:27:21.050 --> 00:27:24.600
It was the stone after all! Amazing!

00:27:40.900 --> 00:27:42.820
We'll float all the way down.

00:27:49.870 --> 00:27:51.710
Amazing! I want it!

00:27:51.960 --> 00:27:53.250
Fire!

00:28:01.590 --> 00:28:04.590
I have to get that amazing stone!

00:28:27.240 --> 00:28:29.410
-It's fading...
-Hey, wait!

00:28:38.380 --> 00:28:40.630
It's just like when you landed.

00:28:43.260 --> 00:28:45.090
The opening looks so tiny.

00:28:45.800 --> 00:28:49.720
I hope the boss and the engineer
aren't in any trouble.

00:28:49.810 --> 00:28:52.890
Aw, don't worry.
Miners aren't exactly wimps.

00:28:52.980 --> 00:28:55.150
Come on, let's find the way out.

00:28:58.150 --> 00:29:02.240
These mines are ancient.
Tunnels everywhere.

00:29:15.580 --> 00:29:16.710
There.

00:29:17.420 --> 00:29:20.170
I'm so happy. I was starving.

00:29:20.670 --> 00:29:23.590
I've still got an apple and some candy.

00:29:24.470 --> 00:29:28.720
It's like you have a magical bag
that holds everything.

00:29:42.690 --> 00:29:45.950
Gondoa? That's so far north.

00:29:46.030 --> 00:29:49.160
Yes. Both my parents died,

00:29:49.240 --> 00:29:51.330
but they left me the house and the fields,

00:29:51.410 --> 00:29:53.330
so I was getting by on my own.

00:30:15.890 --> 00:30:17.980
Those guys with dark glasses
kidnapped you?

00:30:18.060 --> 00:30:18.980
Yes.

00:30:19.060 --> 00:30:20.610
That guy was one of them?

00:30:21.900 --> 00:30:24.530
Who can they be, calling in the army?

00:30:26.490 --> 00:30:29.110
Dola and the other guys,
they all want the stone.

00:30:29.570 --> 00:30:33.740
But I had no idea
it had mysterious powers.

00:30:35.160 --> 00:30:37.830
It was always in our family.

00:30:38.250 --> 00:30:40.420
Mother left it to me when she died.

00:30:41.000 --> 00:30:44.090
She warned me never to show it
or give it to anyone.

00:30:47.510 --> 00:30:49.800
We're both orphans, aren't we?

00:30:49.880 --> 00:30:53.470
I'm sorry I dragged you into all of this.

00:30:53.560 --> 00:30:57.230
When you fell from the sky
my heart was racing.

00:30:57.310 --> 00:30:59.560
I knew something wonderful had begun.

00:31:14.530 --> 00:31:16.700
Little demons... Little demons.

00:31:17.120 --> 00:31:19.830
Uncle Pom! He's really great.

00:31:19.910 --> 00:31:20.960
Uncle Pom.

00:31:22.130 --> 00:31:23.790
We've lost our way.

00:31:24.290 --> 00:31:27.460
Now that little demon
sure looks like Pazu...

00:31:28.460 --> 00:31:32.390
With a little girl demon beside him.

00:31:32.470 --> 00:31:34.470
Pirates are after us.

00:31:35.260 --> 00:31:36.970
And the army.

00:31:39.390 --> 00:31:41.480
How very extraordinary.

00:31:52.360 --> 00:31:54.200
Drink up.

00:31:54.280 --> 00:31:55.410
Thank you.

00:31:56.330 --> 00:31:59.080
Have you always lived underground?

00:32:00.580 --> 00:32:02.000
Why, no, no.

00:32:02.460 --> 00:32:06.040
The rocks have been stirring...

00:32:06.130 --> 00:32:09.130
That's when I like to be down here.

00:32:09.210 --> 00:32:10.470
The rocks were stirring?

00:32:22.190 --> 00:32:24.850
Rocks speak very softly.

00:32:58.720 --> 00:32:59.890
Wonderful...

00:33:00.680 --> 00:33:02.390
Pazu, look at that!

00:33:14.400 --> 00:33:16.570
They were ordinary rocks until...

00:33:17.120 --> 00:33:18.200
How pretty...

00:33:18.280 --> 00:33:21.240
Here, let me show you.

00:33:31.750 --> 00:33:33.130
It's gone.

00:33:33.210 --> 00:33:36.880
These rocks contain volucite.

00:33:36.970 --> 00:33:38.090
Volucite?

00:33:40.600 --> 00:33:45.390
As soon as it's exposed to the air,
it becomes ordinary stone.

00:33:51.110 --> 00:33:52.110
It's glowing...

00:33:54.360 --> 00:33:57.860
Oh, my gracious!
That's a volucite crystal, my dear.

00:33:58.660 --> 00:34:01.490
I've never seen one before.

00:34:04.120 --> 00:34:06.410
That's why the rocks were stirring.

00:34:07.040 --> 00:34:09.460
This stone has mysterious powers.

00:34:11.040 --> 00:34:16.170
I thought only Laputans
knew how to make volucite crystals.

00:34:16.800 --> 00:34:17.970
Laputans?

00:34:18.630 --> 00:34:22.260
They used Volucite to send
a magnificent island aloft...

00:34:22.470 --> 00:34:26.480
Laputa did exist, Sheeta! It really did!

00:34:26.980 --> 00:34:29.770
Does the island still exist?

00:34:31.900 --> 00:34:32.980
Uncle Pom?

00:34:33.730 --> 00:34:36.530
Dear, would you mind covering the stone?

00:34:36.610 --> 00:34:38.240
Its power overwhelms me.

00:34:39.740 --> 00:34:40.780
Yes.

00:34:42.160 --> 00:34:43.830
What's wrong?

00:34:54.090 --> 00:34:56.300
My grandfather told me...

00:34:57.010 --> 00:35:01.550
the rocks stir
when Laputa floats overhead.

00:35:01.640 --> 00:35:05.220
If you went up to the sky then,
you'd find Laputa!

00:35:05.640 --> 00:35:07.930
Sheeta, my father was telling the truth!

00:35:09.190 --> 00:35:11.350
Young lady...

00:35:12.020 --> 00:35:14.320
-You see...
-Yes?

00:35:15.940 --> 00:35:18.690
Your stone is most powerful...

00:35:19.200 --> 00:35:23.700
I know that.
I've been speaking to rocks all my life.

00:35:24.160 --> 00:35:27.200
A stone so powerful brings happiness,

00:35:27.290 --> 00:35:30.710
but it also often brings misery.

00:35:31.210 --> 00:35:32.540
I see.

00:35:32.710 --> 00:35:36.210
What's more,
your stone is the work of men.

00:35:36.550 --> 00:35:38.970
How on earth did you...

00:35:40.050 --> 00:35:41.800
The stone's not dangerous!

00:35:41.880 --> 00:35:44.970
It already saved Sheeta twice!

00:35:45.390 --> 00:35:48.980
Amazing! Laputa really does exist!

00:35:57.980 --> 00:35:59.190
It's gone.

00:35:59.280 --> 00:36:01.360
Let's go back to the ship.

00:36:01.450 --> 00:36:05.280
When it's this quiet,
it's best to stay put.

00:36:07.410 --> 00:36:08.740
I'm hungry...

00:36:10.710 --> 00:36:12.460
It's all clear. Let's go.

00:36:13.250 --> 00:36:14.920
Thank you, Uncle.

00:36:15.000 --> 00:36:16.670
Look after yourselves.

00:36:35.940 --> 00:36:38.690
Look at those clouds!

00:36:54.420 --> 00:36:58.630
Beyond those clouds is an island
we've only dreamed of.

00:37:00.840 --> 00:37:04.380
Here I come! I know
I'm going to find Laputa!

00:37:04.470 --> 00:37:05.380
Pazu...

00:37:06.510 --> 00:37:08.300
I haven't told you everything.

00:37:10.390 --> 00:37:14.560
My family had a mysterious,
ancient name...

00:37:15.020 --> 00:37:16.810
that came with this stone.

00:37:18.270 --> 00:37:20.730
My name is Lucita,

00:37:21.280 --> 00:37:24.240
Lucita Toelle Ur.... Laputa.

00:37:24.780 --> 00:37:26.070
Laputa?

00:37:26.570 --> 00:37:27.660
So you mean...

00:37:31.160 --> 00:37:33.040
It's the army! Run!

00:37:38.580 --> 00:37:39.420
Underground!

00:37:42.550 --> 00:37:43.760
Don't move!

00:37:43.840 --> 00:37:44.840
How dare you!

00:37:46.970 --> 00:37:48.720
Pazu! Let me go!

00:37:51.180 --> 00:37:54.060
Pazu! Pazu!

00:37:55.940 --> 00:37:58.270
-We've apprehended them.
-Good work.

00:38:33.600 --> 00:38:35.060
Open up, open up!

00:38:40.560 --> 00:38:41.610
Sheeta...

00:38:46.110 --> 00:38:48.650
Company, march!

00:39:19.230 --> 00:39:20.060
Use force!

00:39:20.900 --> 00:39:23.940
Squeeze the brat, she'll talk.

00:39:24.570 --> 00:39:26.070
Spoken like a man in uniform.

00:39:27.150 --> 00:39:29.820
In your haste, you risk everything.

00:39:31.110 --> 00:39:35.580
If we'd mobilized sooner,
we'd have bagged Dola too.

00:39:36.740 --> 00:39:39.370
She managed to decipher
your third-rate code.

00:39:39.870 --> 00:39:40.790
What!

00:39:40.870 --> 00:39:43.170
My organization will handle this.

00:39:44.340 --> 00:39:48.170
Concentrate on mobilizing
the troops when the time is ripe.

00:39:50.260 --> 00:39:53.930
Muska! Remember, I command
the search for Laputa!

00:39:54.890 --> 00:39:59.480
Of course. But I have my orders
from the government.

00:40:02.770 --> 00:40:05.360
That pencil-pushing upstart!

00:40:23.000 --> 00:40:23.960
Have a nice rest?

00:40:24.710 --> 00:40:27.130
Where's Pazu? Let me see him!

00:40:27.210 --> 00:40:28.800
No interest in pretty clothes?

00:40:29.510 --> 00:40:31.260
Don't fret about Pazu.

00:40:31.340 --> 00:40:34.010
His stubborn head is harder than mine.

00:40:34.640 --> 00:40:37.560
Come, I have something to show you.

00:40:52.530 --> 00:40:53.650
Enter.

00:41:12.550 --> 00:41:13.590
What is it?

00:41:14.220 --> 00:41:17.640
A mechanical soldier
with vast destructive power.

00:41:18.010 --> 00:41:22.480
Until he fell from the sky,
no one believed Laputa was real.

00:41:39.410 --> 00:41:42.410
He's not of this earth.

00:41:42.910 --> 00:41:45.410
Our science can't even identify...

00:41:45.920 --> 00:41:48.710
what material he's made of.

00:41:49.750 --> 00:41:50.960
Look...

00:41:51.210 --> 00:41:52.420
Don't be afraid.

00:41:52.760 --> 00:41:54.590
He's long dead.

00:42:01.560 --> 00:42:02.520
Look at that.

00:42:08.600 --> 00:42:11.770
This insignia
was carved on your fireplace.

00:42:12.940 --> 00:42:14.070
It's on this stone, too.

00:42:15.440 --> 00:42:18.280
The stone works only in your hands.

00:42:20.950 --> 00:42:22.660
It protects its owner

00:42:22.740 --> 00:42:27.080
and will guide her back to Laputa.

00:42:27.580 --> 00:42:29.880
I know nothing of this!

00:42:30.790 --> 00:42:32.500
Take it if you like.

00:42:33.090 --> 00:42:34.880
Just leave us alone...

00:42:39.130 --> 00:42:43.640
Perhaps you imagine that Laputa
is some kind of treasure island.

00:42:44.270 --> 00:42:48.060
Fearsome scientific power
thrust Laputa into orbit.

00:42:48.140 --> 00:42:51.310
Their dreaded empire once ruled the earth!

00:42:53.480 --> 00:42:56.900
Even you can appreciate
that when such an entity roams the skies,

00:42:57.150 --> 00:43:00.660
it threatens peace.

00:43:01.530 --> 00:43:03.330
I need your cooperation.

00:43:04.330 --> 00:43:09.080
You must know how to make
the stone guide us to Laputa.

00:43:09.830 --> 00:43:13.460
I really don't know!
Please let me see Pazu!

00:43:14.670 --> 00:43:16.920
I intend no harm,

00:43:17.460 --> 00:43:20.260
but his fate rests with you.

00:43:20.720 --> 00:43:21.550
What?

00:43:23.300 --> 00:43:28.850
The boy goes free
if you assist us, Lucita...

00:43:29.480 --> 00:43:31.350
Toelle Ur Laputa.

00:43:33.020 --> 00:43:34.110
But how...

00:43:34.770 --> 00:43:37.860
Ur means ruler. Toelle means True.

00:43:38.360 --> 00:43:42.110
You are Princess Lucita,
rightful heir to the Laputan throne.

00:44:02.260 --> 00:44:03.300
Out!

00:44:06.310 --> 00:44:07.310
Sheeta!

00:44:07.810 --> 00:44:09.180
Pazu, are you hurt?

00:44:09.270 --> 00:44:12.480
I'm fine. You?
Did they do anything horrible?

00:44:12.560 --> 00:44:15.610
My dear Pazu, we misjudged you.
Accept our apologies.

00:44:16.520 --> 00:44:18.610
We didn't know how gallantly...

00:44:19.230 --> 00:44:21.820
you protected her from the pirates.

00:44:21.900 --> 00:44:23.110
Sheeta, what did you...

00:44:24.030 --> 00:44:27.080
Pazu, I beg you, forget about Laputa.

00:44:28.370 --> 00:44:29.500
What!

00:44:29.750 --> 00:44:34.790
Sheeta will aid us
in our search for Laputa.

00:44:35.250 --> 00:44:38.420
I understand how you feel,
but forget about her.

00:44:38.630 --> 00:44:40.340
Is this true, Sheeta? But we...

00:44:40.920 --> 00:44:43.130
Thank you for everything.

00:44:43.220 --> 00:44:45.180
I'll never forget you, Pazu.

00:44:45.840 --> 00:44:47.180
I don't believe it...

00:44:47.930 --> 00:44:49.600
Sheeta, we promised!

00:44:49.890 --> 00:44:50.930
Farewell!

00:44:51.020 --> 00:44:51.890
Sheeta!

00:44:52.480 --> 00:44:53.810
Wait, Sheeta!

00:44:53.890 --> 00:44:55.900
Be reasonable. Act like a man.

00:44:57.360 --> 00:44:58.690
Sheeta!

00:45:06.780 --> 00:45:09.450
Here's a token of our gratitude.

00:45:09.540 --> 00:45:10.790
It's yours.

00:45:48.320 --> 00:45:51.990
Only you can recall the words
that will waken this stone.

00:45:53.160 --> 00:45:55.960
If you keep your promise,
you too shall be free.

00:46:02.340 --> 00:46:03.550
Pazu...

00:46:23.690 --> 00:46:27.610
Mama, it's Pazu! He's back!

00:46:29.660 --> 00:46:30.700
Pazu.

00:46:31.870 --> 00:46:34.870
We were so worried. You just disappeared.

00:46:36.870 --> 00:46:39.290
-And the girl?
-Forget it.

00:46:41.920 --> 00:46:43.170
Pazu!

00:47:17.120 --> 00:47:18.960
Let me go! What are you doing?

00:47:19.500 --> 00:47:21.460
Put a lid on it!

00:47:22.080 --> 00:47:24.090
Nice place you got, kid.

00:47:24.340 --> 00:47:25.500
Get out!

00:47:27.590 --> 00:47:28.760
This is my house!

00:47:30.050 --> 00:47:32.180
Oh, come off it.

00:47:32.260 --> 00:47:34.390
Can't even protect a little girl...

00:47:34.970 --> 00:47:37.060
-What do you say?
-He's got gold!

00:47:37.770 --> 00:47:40.440
Sold her for money, huh?

00:47:40.520 --> 00:47:42.480
No! I wouldn't do that!

00:47:42.560 --> 00:47:45.230
You let them pay you off?

00:47:46.440 --> 00:47:48.820
Sheeta told me to do it.

00:47:49.700 --> 00:47:50.700
So...

00:47:52.280 --> 00:47:54.870
So you gave in and crawled home.

00:47:55.450 --> 00:47:57.450
You call yourself a man?

00:47:58.580 --> 00:48:01.460
You talk big, but you're after Sheeta too.

00:48:01.960 --> 00:48:03.330
But of course, we're pirates.

00:48:03.670 --> 00:48:06.460
Pirates hunt for treasure.

00:48:07.500 --> 00:48:11.470
Those guys are strange ones.
What's the girl to them?

00:48:15.970 --> 00:48:19.470
You think she'll get out alive?

00:48:24.310 --> 00:48:27.020
So, Sheeta told you to leave?

00:48:27.110 --> 00:48:30.490
They threatened her,
so she tried to save you.

00:48:30.820 --> 00:48:32.820
How do you know, Mama?

00:48:33.200 --> 00:48:35.660
I've been a woman for 50 years.

00:48:35.950 --> 00:48:39.910
She steels her heart
to save her man. How touching.

00:48:40.000 --> 00:48:42.210
Reminds me of my youth.

00:48:43.080 --> 00:48:46.500
If you boys want to get married,
look for one like her.

00:48:48.170 --> 00:48:50.510
-So that girl will grow up...
-To be like Mama?

00:48:55.220 --> 00:48:56.970
What a waste.

00:49:01.850 --> 00:49:03.850
I've got all your codes.

00:49:05.850 --> 00:49:07.360
Calling the battle cruiser?

00:49:16.820 --> 00:49:20.410
They'll pack her up and take off?
We better hurry!

00:49:21.040 --> 00:49:22.620
Dinner's over. Move out.

00:49:22.700 --> 00:49:24.410
Yes, Mama.

00:49:27.040 --> 00:49:28.500
Going after Sheeta?

00:49:28.750 --> 00:49:31.050
We want the crystal, not the girl.

00:49:31.130 --> 00:49:34.680
The stone's no good without her.

00:49:35.380 --> 00:49:37.680
Can't I go with you?

00:49:38.260 --> 00:49:39.680
I have to help Sheeta!

00:49:40.100 --> 00:49:43.680
Do it on your own, like a man.

00:49:44.180 --> 00:49:45.060
You're right,

00:49:45.140 --> 00:49:48.060
if I was clever and strong,
I could've defended her.

00:49:48.400 --> 00:49:50.360
Please, I don't care about treasure.

00:49:51.610 --> 00:49:53.530
-Listen to him...
-Shut up!

00:49:53.610 --> 00:49:54.740
Yes!

00:50:01.450 --> 00:50:04.410
He could probably help us with her...

00:50:06.420 --> 00:50:08.290
You'll be an outcast forever.

00:50:08.380 --> 00:50:10.630
-I know.
-You sure?

00:50:10.710 --> 00:50:11.710
Yup!

00:50:13.260 --> 00:50:15.130
Be ready in 40 seconds.

00:50:24.270 --> 00:50:25.600
Take care, you guys.

00:50:34.110 --> 00:50:37.320
Tie this to your belt.
You boys wait on the ship.

00:51:09.640 --> 00:51:11.610
A magnificent vessel.

00:51:12.020 --> 00:51:13.900
Has the girl talked?

00:51:13.980 --> 00:51:15.230
I need a little more time.

00:51:15.860 --> 00:51:19.200
Forget it! We'll squeeze
it out of her up there.

00:51:19.450 --> 00:51:22.370
We depart at dawn, with the girl.

00:51:42.340 --> 00:51:44.970
Step on it, it's almost dawn!

00:51:51.440 --> 00:51:52.560
Sheeta!

00:52:16.630 --> 00:52:18.880
Whatever shall we do?

00:52:21.630 --> 00:52:25.510
Sheeta, listen, I'm going to teach you...

00:52:26.050 --> 00:52:28.350
a magic spell for trouble.

00:52:28.430 --> 00:52:29.560
A magic spell?

00:52:29.640 --> 00:52:32.940
Yes.
These are old, old, old secret words.

00:52:42.900 --> 00:52:47.410
They mean "help me rekindle the light."

00:53:24.780 --> 00:53:26.200
Perfect.

00:53:33.290 --> 00:53:37.380
Just as the ancient books described.
This is the sacred light.

00:53:37.580 --> 00:53:38.460
Sacred light?

00:53:44.420 --> 00:53:47.510
What are the magic words? Tell me.

00:53:57.400 --> 00:53:58.810
-Let's go.
-Yeah.

00:54:09.280 --> 00:54:10.700
It's moving!

00:54:15.750 --> 00:54:17.460
The robot, it's alive!

00:54:18.330 --> 00:54:19.500
Hello!

00:54:32.850 --> 00:54:34.350
Help!

00:54:39.810 --> 00:54:42.230
It's alive! It's the robot!

00:54:49.950 --> 00:54:51.030
The robot?

00:55:03.800 --> 00:55:04.710
It's coming this way.

00:55:10.140 --> 00:55:11.220
Run!

00:55:18.390 --> 00:55:20.520
Retreat! Retreat!

00:55:22.900 --> 00:55:24.270
Incredible!

00:55:31.910 --> 00:55:33.320
I see!

00:55:35.410 --> 00:55:36.330
It's the light!

00:55:37.080 --> 00:55:39.830
The sacred light broke his seal!

00:55:40.790 --> 00:55:42.920
The way to Laputa is open! Come!

00:55:43.000 --> 00:55:43.840
No!

00:56:05.150 --> 00:56:06.480
It can fly!

00:56:58.660 --> 00:56:59.910
It's pointing to the sky...

00:57:05.130 --> 00:57:07.540
It's showing the way to Laputa.

00:57:08.500 --> 00:57:09.960
Hurry!

00:57:10.460 --> 00:57:13.680
Explosives?
Idiot! You'll blow up the fortress!

00:57:15.840 --> 00:57:17.930
Hello, hello! What is this!

00:57:19.100 --> 00:57:20.930
-Good.
-We're connected.

00:57:21.810 --> 00:57:25.190
This is Colonel Muska.
The robot cut communication with the ship.

00:57:25.980 --> 00:57:28.690
I've assumed emergency command.

00:57:29.190 --> 00:57:31.610
It's after the girl on the tower.

00:57:31.690 --> 00:57:33.780
Take it down on sight.

00:57:33.990 --> 00:57:36.820
Prepare to fire.

00:57:42.870 --> 00:57:44.620
Hurry! Hurry up!

00:58:05.980 --> 00:58:07.100
Fire!

00:58:24.620 --> 00:58:25.790
Hurry!

00:58:29.130 --> 00:58:30.920
-We did it.
-Amazing!

00:58:31.000 --> 00:58:32.170
Get the girl.

00:58:36.590 --> 00:58:37.840
Is she dead?

00:58:37.930 --> 00:58:38.930
Get up!

00:58:41.760 --> 00:58:43.350
-She just fainted.
-Stand!

00:58:45.430 --> 00:58:46.600
It moved...

00:59:36.480 --> 00:59:38.530
What's that? Looks like a war.

00:59:38.610 --> 00:59:41.240
-Let's go, Dola!
-That's Captain, to you!

00:59:47.540 --> 00:59:49.290
Lower, Charles.

01:00:08.350 --> 01:00:10.310
Stop! Stop it!

01:00:10.600 --> 01:00:11.890
Please!

01:00:20.860 --> 01:00:23.360
Mama, Goliath's pushing off!

01:00:30.370 --> 01:00:33.920
We're going directly into
the crossfire. Regroup!

01:00:34.000 --> 01:00:35.960
-Look, there's Sheeta!
-Where?

01:00:38.250 --> 01:00:39.340
Where?

01:00:39.420 --> 01:00:42.630
Straight ahead.
She's on top of that tower!

01:00:51.230 --> 01:00:54.480
This is a job for a woman! Cover me.

01:01:06.620 --> 01:01:08.280
Sheeta!

01:01:10.620 --> 01:01:12.160
I'm coming, Sheeta!

01:01:12.620 --> 01:01:13.920
Pazu!

01:01:15.960 --> 01:01:17.710
Fly closer!

01:01:21.630 --> 01:01:22.840
Pazu!

01:01:23.930 --> 01:01:25.590
Let me go!

01:01:46.530 --> 01:01:47.780
Sheeta!

01:01:50.330 --> 01:01:51.490
Dola!

01:01:56.620 --> 01:01:58.000
Pazu!

01:02:08.510 --> 01:02:09.640
Pazu!

01:02:30.070 --> 01:02:31.240
Pull up!

01:02:37.580 --> 01:02:40.500
Last chance! Grab her on the fly!

01:02:42.550 --> 01:02:43.420
Pazu!

01:02:43.880 --> 01:02:45.550
-Here goes!
-All right!

01:02:47.720 --> 01:02:49.510
Move aside! Damn!

01:02:49.590 --> 01:02:50.600
Sheeta!

01:02:56.930 --> 01:02:58.850
What's Goliath doing?

01:03:05.530 --> 01:03:06.440
A smoke screen?

01:03:20.370 --> 01:03:22.500
Where's the robot?

01:03:22.840 --> 01:03:24.920
Destroyed. The girl went that way.

01:03:25.000 --> 01:03:26.300
What!

01:03:31.550 --> 01:03:34.850
Put out the fire! Organize a search party!

01:03:49.530 --> 01:03:51.570
We haven't lost the sacred stone.

01:03:54.370 --> 01:03:56.240
Its light points to Laputa...

01:03:57.790 --> 01:04:01.370
Inform the general, we'll depart
for Laputa as planned.

01:04:39.450 --> 01:04:40.660
Lucky guy...

01:04:41.210 --> 01:04:45.170
I can't believe she'll grow up
to be just like Mama...

01:04:50.380 --> 01:04:53.680
There's your valley...
Right back where we started.

01:04:55.800 --> 01:04:58.060
Dola, please take us aboard.

01:04:58.470 --> 01:04:59.930
Call me Captain!

01:05:00.100 --> 01:05:03.270
What use are you without the crystal?

01:05:03.980 --> 01:05:05.100
We'll work.

01:05:05.190 --> 01:05:08.230
I want to see Laputa for myself.

01:05:15.160 --> 01:05:19.240
Don't want any treasure?
You just want to see Laputa?

01:05:19.950 --> 01:05:22.000
Suspect motives
for boarding a pirate ship.

01:05:22.500 --> 01:05:24.620
Are they coming with us, Mama?

01:05:24.710 --> 01:05:27.420
One false move and you're shark bait!

01:05:28.170 --> 01:05:31.590
Excellent! No more laundry
or cleaning duty!

01:05:31.670 --> 01:05:33.260
Or dish washing!

01:05:33.340 --> 01:05:36.090
Or potato peeling!

01:05:40.510 --> 01:05:43.480
-Can you make pudding?
-Yes...

01:05:43.560 --> 01:05:45.440
I like mincemeat pie.

01:05:46.060 --> 01:05:49.440
I eat, uhm... anything!

01:05:49.770 --> 01:05:51.400
Enough out of you!

01:05:51.480 --> 01:05:54.200
When will those boys ever grow up?

01:06:40.990 --> 01:06:41.910
Get off!

01:06:46.210 --> 01:06:48.330
Canvas. It's made of cloth.

01:06:48.420 --> 01:06:49.830
And don't tear it.

01:06:50.920 --> 01:06:53.380
Hurry up, it's crowded in here!

01:06:59.640 --> 01:07:01.430
Hurry, this way!

01:07:02.560 --> 01:07:03.930
I hate dawdlers.

01:07:04.770 --> 01:07:06.060
You're with me!

01:07:06.140 --> 01:07:07.230
Pazu!

01:07:07.440 --> 01:07:08.940
I don't bite. Come.

01:07:09.940 --> 01:07:12.110
You're not here for fun.

01:07:16.940 --> 01:07:18.610
What an engine.

01:07:18.950 --> 01:07:23.120
Now where'd he go? Pops! Pops!

01:07:24.660 --> 01:07:27.370
Look, we got you an assistant.

01:07:28.460 --> 01:07:30.540
Don't holler.

01:07:30.830 --> 01:07:32.130
I hear you.

01:07:35.460 --> 01:07:37.970
He's tougher than Mama. Be careful.

01:07:43.300 --> 01:07:45.310
My hand doesn't fit.

01:07:47.480 --> 01:07:48.810
This gasket?

01:07:48.890 --> 01:07:50.310
-Name?
-Pazu.

01:07:52.940 --> 01:07:56.400
The crystal pointed nearly due east...

01:07:57.070 --> 01:07:58.570
You sure about that?

01:07:59.320 --> 01:08:01.820
I could see the sunrise from the tower.

01:08:02.110 --> 01:08:04.120
It's the harvest season now...

01:08:04.870 --> 01:08:08.330
so the sun rises just south of due east.

01:08:08.410 --> 01:08:11.420
The light pointed to the left
of where the sun rose.

01:08:11.500 --> 01:08:13.880
Good answer. Any luck?

01:08:14.630 --> 01:08:16.630
Not a peep.

01:08:16.710 --> 01:08:19.470
They're maintaining radio silence,
aren't they?

01:08:19.550 --> 01:08:22.510
Mama, Goliath's faster. What do we do?

01:08:23.090 --> 01:08:25.680
We're upwind of them.

01:08:26.060 --> 01:08:28.520
If we get a lift on the trade winds...

01:08:29.230 --> 01:08:31.520
My abacus from the Far East.

01:08:31.980 --> 01:08:33.810
Windspeed is 10... and...

01:08:35.360 --> 01:08:36.520
I think we can catch up.

01:08:39.190 --> 01:08:40.820
Okay, listen up!

01:08:41.360 --> 01:08:44.120
<i>Goliath's on its way to Laputa.</i>

01:08:44.200 --> 01:08:46.830
<i>We're on their tail.</i>

01:08:47.080 --> 01:08:50.040
<i>With these winds,</i>
<i>I expect contact tomorrow.</i>

01:08:50.410 --> 01:08:54.080
<i>Ten gold pieces</i>
<i>to whoever spots her first!</i>

01:08:54.170 --> 01:08:55.040
Ten!

01:08:55.540 --> 01:08:57.380
<i>Whatever we find,</i>

01:08:57.460 --> 01:09:00.880
<i>I'm sure Laputa has riches enough</i>
<i>for any pirate gang!</i>

01:09:01.800 --> 01:09:03.880
Earn your keep, boys!

01:09:12.560 --> 01:09:13.690
Now!

01:09:21.070 --> 01:09:23.490
Course 98, speed 40.

01:09:53.890 --> 01:09:56.310
That getup of yours won't work.

01:09:58.020 --> 01:09:59.060
Wear these.

01:10:10.280 --> 01:10:11.950
Your station.

01:10:15.790 --> 01:10:16.710
Beautiful...

01:10:23.260 --> 01:10:25.420
You serve five meals a day.

01:10:25.720 --> 01:10:27.640
Go easy on the water.

01:10:35.350 --> 01:10:38.100
Get to work, you idiots!

01:11:29.700 --> 01:11:30.780
Yes?

01:11:35.370 --> 01:11:38.040
I'm sorry, dinner isn't ready yet.

01:11:38.620 --> 01:11:41.000
I've never cooked on an airship...

01:11:43.040 --> 01:11:44.250
Do you need something?

01:11:46.840 --> 01:11:48.510
-Beautiful...
-What?

01:11:49.510 --> 01:11:53.220
I thought I'd give you
a hand in my spare time.

01:11:53.300 --> 01:11:54.760
Why thank you.

01:11:54.850 --> 01:11:57.270
Can you put those dishes away?

01:11:57.350 --> 01:11:58.980
Happy to obli...

01:12:02.520 --> 01:12:04.980
You said your stomach hurt...

01:12:05.440 --> 01:12:07.740
I've got some free time. Can I...

01:12:09.570 --> 01:12:10.740
You're in the way.

01:12:11.570 --> 01:12:13.450
Some stomachache, jerk!

01:12:13.530 --> 01:12:14.660
Hey, can I help...

01:12:25.170 --> 01:12:29.670
You've changed, chasing the likes
of Goliath...

01:12:30.170 --> 01:12:31.800
But it's pointless.

01:12:31.880 --> 01:12:34.260
It's Laputan treasure I'm after.

01:12:35.720 --> 01:12:38.560
They're certainly nice kids...

01:12:38.640 --> 01:12:40.890
Get to the point, you old goat.

01:12:40.980 --> 01:12:45.400
They're too upright and honest
to ever respect you.

01:12:45.480 --> 01:12:46.520
What's that!

01:12:46.610 --> 01:12:49.230
No, I mean... Check...

01:12:50.190 --> 01:12:53.030
Excellent... delicious...

01:12:56.780 --> 01:12:58.950
Seconds anyone?

01:12:59.500 --> 01:13:01.620
-Okay.
-More! More! More!

01:13:20.310 --> 01:13:21.980
Hey, shake a leg.

01:13:25.560 --> 01:13:27.190
It's your watch.

01:13:27.730 --> 01:13:28.860
Take it, it's cold.

01:13:29.190 --> 01:13:30.690
-Watch?
-Yeah.

01:13:36.570 --> 01:13:38.700
Darn cold! Go on up.

01:13:46.790 --> 01:13:49.130
-My turn.
-Great.

01:14:02.140 --> 01:14:03.270
Sheeta!

01:14:08.360 --> 01:14:09.650
That was scary!

01:14:10.980 --> 01:14:12.690
The sky is beautiful.

01:14:24.410 --> 01:14:26.210
Sheeta. Get in.

01:14:30.590 --> 01:14:31.670
<i>Can't you sleep?</i>

01:14:33.050 --> 01:14:34.590
<i>Nice and warm...</i>

01:14:34.970 --> 01:14:36.430
<i>Look aft.</i>

01:14:40.390 --> 01:14:41.390
Pazu?

01:14:42.100 --> 01:14:43.100
What?

01:14:43.390 --> 01:14:45.680
I'm really scared.

01:14:46.770 --> 01:14:49.230
<i>I really don't want to go to Laputa.</i>

01:14:49.900 --> 01:14:52.980
<i>I hope we never find Goliath.</i>

01:14:53.070 --> 01:14:56.900
<i>-You mean--</i>
<i>-No, the light pointed the right way.</i>

01:14:57.570 --> 01:14:58.610
<i>But...</i>

01:14:59.320 --> 01:15:01.240
<i>You mean the robot?</i>

01:15:03.410 --> 01:15:04.790
<i>Poor thing.</i>

01:15:06.870 --> 01:15:10.420
<i>I never dreamed</i>
<i>that little spell would work.</i>

01:15:12.250 --> 01:15:15.550
<i>I learned lots of other spells.</i>

01:15:15.800 --> 01:15:18.340
<i>To help find things, cure the sick.</i>

01:15:18.430 --> 01:15:20.840
<i>And one I must never, ever use.</i>

01:15:20.930 --> 01:15:22.550
<i>Never, ever use?</i>

01:15:22.640 --> 01:15:23.930
<i>A spell of destruction.</i>

01:15:24.430 --> 01:15:30.730
<i>I had to learn bad ones</i>
<i>so the good spells had power.</i>

01:15:31.440 --> 01:15:33.770
I was so scared, I couldn't sleep.

01:15:35.110 --> 01:15:37.740
That stone should be locked away.

01:15:38.450 --> 01:15:41.240
They hid it in the fireplace.

01:15:41.320 --> 01:15:43.240
It was only worn for weddings.

01:15:43.950 --> 01:15:48.460
<i>My mother's and grandmother's</i>
<i>and great-grandmother's.</i>

01:15:49.540 --> 01:15:52.040
I should have thrown it away.

01:15:52.290 --> 01:15:56.130
You're wrong. We met thanks to the stone.

01:15:57.050 --> 01:15:59.630
Throwing it away
won't make Laputa disappear.

01:16:00.590 --> 01:16:04.680
Airships are improving.
Someone will find it.

01:16:05.970 --> 01:16:08.520
<i>I don't know what to do,</i>

01:16:08.600 --> 01:16:10.810
<i>but if Laputa is so dangerous...</i>

01:16:10.890 --> 01:16:13.310
<i>it's not for the likes of Muska.</i>

01:16:13.980 --> 01:16:15.020
Besides...

01:16:16.190 --> 01:16:19.110
If we run now, they'll hunt us forever.

01:16:19.440 --> 01:16:21.950
But don't become a pirate for me.

01:16:22.990 --> 01:16:24.660
I won't become a pirate.

01:16:25.450 --> 01:16:28.750
<i>Dola understands.</i>
<i>She's nicer than she looks.</i>

01:16:29.750 --> 01:16:33.170
Once things are settled,
I'll take you to Gondoa.

01:16:33.920 --> 01:16:38.170
I want to see where you were born,
the valley, the yaks...

01:16:39.550 --> 01:16:40.590
<i>Pazu...</i>

01:16:42.380 --> 01:16:43.680
<i>What's that!</i>

01:16:44.260 --> 01:16:45.970
Below us, look!

01:16:53.850 --> 01:16:55.770
Goliath, right below us!

01:17:01.190 --> 01:17:02.780
Come about! Full rudder!

01:17:33.480 --> 01:17:36.400
We should go after them.
They'll be trouble if we don't!

01:17:36.810 --> 01:17:38.770
We can't catch them in these clouds.

01:17:39.570 --> 01:17:42.320
We'll get them. They won't go far.

01:17:43.110 --> 01:17:45.070
Steady as she goes.

01:17:57.920 --> 01:17:59.750
We're farther north than I thought.

01:18:00.420 --> 01:18:02.260
Pazu, listen up! Time's running out.

01:18:03.050 --> 01:18:05.220
<i>If we lose Goliath, it's all over.</i>

01:18:05.300 --> 01:18:08.600
<i>Your eyes are sharp.</i>
<i>Track them from the crow's nest.</i>

01:18:08.680 --> 01:18:09.600
What do I do?

01:18:10.010 --> 01:18:13.100
That lookout post is a glider.
See the crank?

01:18:13.770 --> 01:18:16.060
Yeah.
<i>-Turn it clockwise.</i>

01:18:19.110 --> 01:18:22.610
Once it's locked,
the upper lever unfolds the wings.

01:18:27.820 --> 01:18:31.370
<i>Use the wire to stabilize them.</i>
<i>Figure out how to steer as you go!</i>

01:18:32.160 --> 01:18:34.080
-Sheeta, you there?
-<i>Yes.</i>

01:18:34.160 --> 01:18:36.790
Get back down here.
<i>-Why?</i>

01:18:37.330 --> 01:18:39.130
Because you're a girl!

01:18:40.000 --> 01:18:41.840
But so are you!

01:18:41.920 --> 01:18:44.090
Besides,
I'm a mountain girl with sharp eyes.

01:18:44.170 --> 01:18:46.010
-Sheeta!
-Please.

01:18:46.090 --> 01:18:47.380
Pazu agrees.

01:18:51.050 --> 01:18:53.010
Once you're aloft,
the voice tube won't work.

01:18:53.100 --> 01:18:54.810
See the head set?

01:18:56.940 --> 01:18:58.400
<i>You mean this, right?</i>

01:18:58.480 --> 01:18:59.690
Wow...

01:19:00.230 --> 01:19:02.690
Okay. I'll give it a try. Release us.

01:19:03.440 --> 01:19:04.610
<i>Here goes.</i>

01:19:24.380 --> 01:19:25.550
They're gone.

01:19:25.800 --> 01:19:27.220
Slipped into the clouds.

01:19:27.920 --> 01:19:30.220
<i>Look sharp! They could be anywhere.</i>

01:19:31.010 --> 01:19:32.010
Aye!

01:19:34.720 --> 01:19:36.020
Hold on tight.

01:19:42.440 --> 01:19:43.610
<i>What's wrong!</i>

01:19:43.690 --> 01:19:45.360
We're fine.

01:19:46.440 --> 01:19:47.860
Just ran into a gust of wind.

01:19:49.610 --> 01:19:51.280
We're keeping watch.

01:19:52.280 --> 01:19:53.910
-Scared?
-No.

01:19:54.620 --> 01:19:57.540
I'm getting the hang of it.
Rough skies ahead.

01:20:01.290 --> 01:20:03.420
Sheeta, get the rope from my bag.

01:20:03.500 --> 01:20:04.670
Okay.

01:20:05.880 --> 01:20:08.470
-Tie yourself to me.
-Okay.

01:20:12.140 --> 01:20:14.180
The mercury's dropping, Mama...

01:20:14.260 --> 01:20:16.930
Lousy luck. Storm coming up...

01:20:17.020 --> 01:20:18.310
How long 'til dawn?

01:20:18.390 --> 01:20:19.560
One more hour.

01:20:36.330 --> 01:20:37.330
It's dawn.

01:20:37.990 --> 01:20:41.410
Strange that the sun's rising
on that side...

01:20:41.500 --> 01:20:45.210
I know! We're supposed
to be heading east. Bridge!

01:20:45.670 --> 01:20:48.000
What! We're heading north?

01:20:48.090 --> 01:20:49.880
The compass is pointing east.

01:20:49.970 --> 01:20:53.550
The shifting winds
must have put us off course.

01:20:53.640 --> 01:20:56.890
<i>-Look!</i>
-What is it? Goliath?

01:20:56.970 --> 01:20:59.350
<i>It's a cloud. A huge one...</i>

01:21:00.060 --> 01:21:01.230
A cloud?

01:21:01.770 --> 01:21:03.350
It's headed for us!

01:21:17.620 --> 01:21:18.450
A castle in the sky...

01:21:18.910 --> 01:21:21.660
We're headed into a low pressure system.

01:21:21.960 --> 01:21:24.460
Turn her away, full speed!

01:21:43.100 --> 01:21:44.850
It's sucking us in.

01:21:44.940 --> 01:21:46.520
<i>Hold tight, we can't help!</i>

01:21:54.200 --> 01:21:55.490
The helm won't move!

01:21:55.570 --> 01:21:57.780
Where's your brute strength?

01:21:57.870 --> 01:22:00.660
Engine's burning up!

01:22:01.240 --> 01:22:04.080
Stop whining and figure something out!

01:22:05.500 --> 01:22:06.920
We're clearing the clouds!

01:22:13.970 --> 01:22:15.430
Sheeta, the ocean!

01:22:28.270 --> 01:22:29.440
The Dragon's Lair!

01:22:29.940 --> 01:22:31.940
So this is the Dragon's Lair...

01:22:42.790 --> 01:22:45.960
Just as Dad said.
The wind's blowing the other way.

01:22:50.420 --> 01:22:52.920
Look out, a wall of wind!

01:22:53.000 --> 01:22:55.340
Mama! It's sucking us in!

01:22:55.420 --> 01:22:57.840
Don't give up! Be a man!

01:22:57.930 --> 01:23:00.180
<i>Bridge! It's Laputa!</i>

01:23:00.260 --> 01:23:01.470
What was that?

01:23:01.970 --> 01:23:04.810
Dad saw Laputa inside the Dragon's Lair.

01:23:05.480 --> 01:23:08.480
Don't be ridiculous!
It'll tear you to pieces!

01:23:08.560 --> 01:23:10.560
Pazu! Look.

01:23:14.610 --> 01:23:15.860
Just what we need.

01:23:27.660 --> 01:23:31.880
Let's go for it! Dad did it.
He made it back.

01:23:32.460 --> 01:23:34.130
All right, into the Dragon's Lair!

01:23:47.060 --> 01:23:49.060
Got 'em!

01:23:49.980 --> 01:23:52.190
Our ship's in danger. We must withdraw.

01:23:52.270 --> 01:23:53.860
-Stay on course.
-What?

01:23:54.150 --> 01:23:57.030
The light's pointing right into the cloud.

01:23:58.700 --> 01:24:01.820
Laputa's in there.

01:24:01.910 --> 01:24:05.120
Stay on course. We'll find a way in.

01:24:17.710 --> 01:24:19.590
-Here we go, Sheeta!
-Okay.

01:27:18.100 --> 01:27:21.270
Sheeta, Sheeta! Are you all right?

01:27:27.280 --> 01:27:28.240
Look...

01:27:42.920 --> 01:27:44.000
Laputa...

01:27:46.170 --> 01:27:47.130
I'm sorry.

01:27:48.260 --> 01:27:51.050
Wait... I tied it really tight.

01:27:54.720 --> 01:27:56.270
My hands are shaking...

01:28:15.580 --> 01:28:16.700
We did it!

01:28:36.430 --> 01:28:37.470
Birds...

01:28:38.980 --> 01:28:40.440
Where is everyone?

01:28:51.650 --> 01:28:53.030
Coming to greet you?

01:28:53.110 --> 01:28:55.530
But I don't have the stone.

01:28:55.620 --> 01:28:56.660
I'll cut the rope.

01:29:17.390 --> 01:29:19.180
-What are you doing!
-Wait.

01:29:19.560 --> 01:29:23.190
Please don't break that.
We need it to get home.

01:29:39.830 --> 01:29:41.290
A flycatcher's nest!

01:29:41.620 --> 01:29:42.870
That's why he's here?

01:29:48.840 --> 01:29:51.670
See? All your eggs are fine.

01:29:52.010 --> 01:29:53.130
The birds aren't afraid.

01:30:01.310 --> 01:30:02.140
It says to follow.

01:30:02.230 --> 01:30:04.230
-You understand it?
-Just intuition.

01:30:28.840 --> 01:30:30.170
It's a city...

01:30:58.030 --> 01:31:00.370
What an amazing place...

01:31:04.450 --> 01:31:06.160
You can see the sky!

01:31:16.170 --> 01:31:20.720
If their science
was so advanced, what happened?

01:32:19.200 --> 01:32:22.370
It's a grave.
I wish I could read the writing.

01:32:25.370 --> 01:32:26.620
Someone left flowers.

01:32:30.750 --> 01:32:32.460
Do you leave the flowers?

01:32:34.540 --> 01:32:36.340
-Pazu!
-It's a different robot!

01:32:41.880 --> 01:32:43.930
It must've broken down long ago...

01:32:56.820 --> 01:32:58.730
Probably a gardener robot.

01:33:00.570 --> 01:33:04.070
It protected this place
even after the people went away.

01:33:19.050 --> 01:33:21.510
You picked flowers for the grave.

01:33:24.800 --> 01:33:25.680
Thank you.

01:33:28.010 --> 01:33:29.770
Are you all alone?

01:33:30.220 --> 01:33:32.600
Are there any other robots here?

01:33:58.790 --> 01:34:00.960
He doesn't seem to be lonely.

01:34:01.420 --> 01:34:05.260
He's got friends and birds' nests
to look after...

01:34:22.150 --> 01:34:23.110
This way!

01:34:35.160 --> 01:34:36.540
This section's been destroyed.

01:34:56.480 --> 01:34:58.100
They got the <i>Tiger Moth.</i>

01:34:58.190 --> 01:35:00.020
I hope the pirates are okay.

01:35:02.190 --> 01:35:04.190
Sheeta, look there!

01:35:04.860 --> 01:35:06.280
They're prisoners!

01:35:07.200 --> 01:35:08.950
They hang pirates.

01:35:09.030 --> 01:35:10.870
-We must help them.
-Let's go!

01:35:17.040 --> 01:35:19.040
We found a way in.

01:35:19.540 --> 01:35:21.540
Look at this, mountains of treasure.

01:35:22.000 --> 01:35:24.550
W... What?

01:35:24.880 --> 01:35:26.300
Wow...

01:35:27.220 --> 01:35:29.430
Want some?

01:35:29.510 --> 01:35:32.140
I'll give you plenty of rope.

01:35:32.720 --> 01:35:35.140
Have you reported that we found Laputa?

01:35:35.220 --> 01:35:36.060
Just about to.

01:35:36.600 --> 01:35:39.560
Make the code good and complicated.

01:35:39.650 --> 01:35:43.070
Hey! No looting!

01:35:44.020 --> 01:35:46.530
The perfect distraction for those idiots.

01:36:04.040 --> 01:36:05.460
What amazing roots.

01:36:05.880 --> 01:36:07.380
You can climb trees, can't you?

01:36:10.050 --> 01:36:11.010
I see a way.

01:36:44.750 --> 01:36:46.460
No better than thieves.

01:36:47.250 --> 01:36:49.550
If they reach the garden...!

01:36:50.420 --> 01:36:51.930
Sheeta, let's find the stone!

01:36:54.430 --> 01:36:56.890
It's the only way to stop them.

01:36:57.640 --> 01:36:59.430
I was wondering why the clouds parted.

01:37:00.310 --> 01:37:03.440
It was so they could land.

01:37:04.400 --> 01:37:06.110
Was it my spell?

01:37:06.650 --> 01:37:09.940
Muska was right. The seal's broken.

01:37:11.030 --> 01:37:13.160
The kingdom's waking up.

01:37:13.530 --> 01:37:16.450
It's welcomed the visitor with the stone.

01:37:17.490 --> 01:37:19.450
But Muska will become king.

01:37:20.500 --> 01:37:22.830
He's got much worse in mind.

01:37:22.920 --> 01:37:26.880
But what do I do
when I get the stone back...

01:37:28.250 --> 01:37:29.590
Wait, that spell!

01:37:29.880 --> 01:37:33.300
You mean... the destruction spell?

01:38:01.000 --> 01:38:02.250
Down and around.

01:38:20.510 --> 01:38:22.060
-I'll go first.
-Okay.

01:38:41.200 --> 01:38:42.240
It's here somewhere.

01:38:53.210 --> 01:38:54.300
Please, God...

01:39:00.390 --> 01:39:01.390
This is it!

01:39:12.230 --> 01:39:13.400
It's that kid.

01:39:17.360 --> 01:39:18.410
No!

01:39:18.700 --> 01:39:19.660
Don't shoot! Capture her.

01:39:21.910 --> 01:39:24.580
Well, if it isn't the little princess.

01:39:25.040 --> 01:39:26.370
Sheeta! Damn!

01:39:29.630 --> 01:39:30.960
What is it, Colonel?

01:39:31.880 --> 01:39:35.460
The last of the pirates.
There's one right under you.

01:39:35.880 --> 01:39:37.630
Yes sir!

01:39:40.890 --> 01:39:42.350
Sheeta, wait for me!

01:39:43.390 --> 01:39:44.470
Pazu!

01:39:47.850 --> 01:39:48.890
Grenades!

01:39:49.560 --> 01:39:50.900
Is that Pazu?

01:39:54.940 --> 01:39:55.980
What was that?

01:39:57.440 --> 01:39:58.610
No, it wasn't.

01:40:03.910 --> 01:40:06.870
-What's wrong?
-Over here!

01:40:07.290 --> 01:40:08.870
The general is over there.

01:40:09.290 --> 01:40:12.290
Militia, fall in on the double.

01:40:19.130 --> 01:40:20.220
Dola!

01:40:20.680 --> 01:40:22.010
They've got Sheeta.

01:40:22.340 --> 01:40:25.390
I'm going after her. I'll cut your ropes.

01:40:34.360 --> 01:40:35.650
Get out of here.

01:40:36.110 --> 01:40:37.400
Hey, wait!

01:40:39.820 --> 01:40:41.110
Take this.

01:40:42.950 --> 01:40:43.990
Thanks.

01:40:47.490 --> 01:40:49.160
The boy has become a man.

01:40:49.710 --> 01:40:50.540
What!

01:40:51.170 --> 01:40:54.130
Muska destroyed all the radio equipment?

01:40:54.210 --> 01:40:57.050
Yes, while the ship was lightly guarded.

01:40:57.710 --> 01:40:59.920
Several guards are badly wounded.

01:41:00.170 --> 01:41:02.300
The colonel entered
the inner palace with the girl.

01:41:02.840 --> 01:41:04.220
The soldiers saw him.

01:41:05.100 --> 01:41:08.470
That upstart's finally showing his colors.

01:41:08.560 --> 01:41:10.310
Hunt him down and arrest him!

01:41:10.600 --> 01:41:11.730
All units!

01:41:11.810 --> 01:41:13.310
Hey! Hurry!

01:41:14.190 --> 01:41:16.150
Shoot if he resists!

01:41:16.610 --> 01:41:18.150
Find the entrance.

01:41:40.090 --> 01:41:42.340
Where are we, Colonel?

01:41:42.420 --> 01:41:44.050
Laputa's core.

01:41:44.130 --> 01:41:46.050
The castle above is just a trifle.

01:41:47.050 --> 01:41:50.640
All of Laputa's knowledge
is crystallized here.

01:41:56.770 --> 01:41:58.190
You two wait here.

01:41:58.440 --> 01:41:59.570
Colonel!

01:42:00.440 --> 01:42:03.570
Only royalty may enter the sacred area.

01:42:06.870 --> 01:42:07.950
What is this!

01:42:10.910 --> 01:42:12.870
The roots have invaded...

01:42:15.540 --> 01:42:18.210
Eventually, we'll burn them all.

01:42:18.880 --> 01:42:20.090
Come, this way.

01:42:31.560 --> 01:42:32.850
Darn it...

01:42:33.640 --> 01:42:34.850
Yes...

01:42:35.140 --> 01:42:36.350
This is it!

01:42:44.110 --> 01:42:45.320
Here, too!

01:42:49.780 --> 01:42:50.990
Screw it...

01:43:01.130 --> 01:43:02.250
Found it!

01:43:05.970 --> 01:43:08.340
Behold the giant crystal!

01:43:08.800 --> 01:43:11.680
Source of Laputa's power.

01:43:12.180 --> 01:43:13.430
Fantastic.

01:43:13.520 --> 01:43:16.980
It has awaited the king's return
for 700 years.

01:43:17.390 --> 01:43:18.480
700 years?

01:43:19.650 --> 01:43:22.900
Your family forgot even that?

01:43:29.320 --> 01:43:32.530
The black rock! As the epics described!

01:43:39.670 --> 01:43:41.290
I can read it. I know what it says!

01:43:43.210 --> 01:43:44.300
Just who are you?

01:43:46.210 --> 01:43:50.760
I too have an ancient,
secret name, Lucita.

01:43:51.260 --> 01:43:53.810
My name is Romuska Palo Ur Laputa.

01:43:57.180 --> 01:44:01.310
We are descended
from the same royal family.

01:44:02.360 --> 01:44:04.820
Later it split into two branches.

01:44:14.950 --> 01:44:17.960
Not even a crack. It's indestructible.

01:44:18.540 --> 01:44:20.460
Deploy all our explosives.

01:44:20.540 --> 01:44:24.040
<i>Force won't be necessary, Your Excellency.</i>

01:44:24.130 --> 01:44:25.460
Muska, where are you!

01:45:19.220 --> 01:45:24.350
<i>What are you waiting for, General?</i>

01:45:25.110 --> 01:45:27.980
All right, after me!

01:45:40.120 --> 01:45:41.460
Forward!

01:45:42.620 --> 01:45:46.210
What is this! Muska, where are you?

01:45:46.590 --> 01:45:47.920
<i>Silence!</i>

01:45:53.180 --> 01:45:54.550
What on earth!

01:45:56.970 --> 01:45:58.760
<i>Watch your tongue.</i>

01:45:58.970 --> 01:46:00.970
<i>You're in the presence of Laputa's king.</i>

01:46:01.560 --> 01:46:02.980
Are you insane?

01:46:03.440 --> 01:46:09.230
<i>Let's celebrate Laputa's return</i>
<i>with a demonstration of its power.</i>

01:46:10.190 --> 01:46:11.360
Sheeta!

01:46:11.570 --> 01:46:14.740
<i>Behold Laputa's thunder!</i>

01:46:15.530 --> 01:46:16.700
Sheeta.

01:46:38.850 --> 01:46:42.970
<i>It's the heavenly fire that</i>
<i>destroyed Sodom and Gomorrah.</i>

01:46:43.560 --> 01:46:46.980
<i>It's the Ramayana's Arrow of Indra.</i>

01:46:47.560 --> 01:46:51.230
<i>The world shall bow down</i>
<i>before Laputa once more!</i>

01:46:52.530 --> 01:46:55.990
Wonderful, Muska. You're a hero.

01:46:56.320 --> 01:46:58.410
A monumental achievement.

01:47:02.410 --> 01:47:03.370
What?

01:47:04.960 --> 01:47:08.250
<i>I grow tired of your stupid face.</i>

01:47:11.250 --> 01:47:12.590
Run, everyone!

01:47:13.760 --> 01:47:15.090
<i>Die!</i>

01:47:42.370 --> 01:47:44.290
-It's those monsters!
-Look at them...

01:47:44.370 --> 01:47:45.700
Run!

01:47:50.460 --> 01:47:52.290
Are the Flaptors okay?

01:47:54.090 --> 01:47:55.210
Ready to fly!

01:47:55.300 --> 01:47:56.510
Let's hurry!

01:47:56.590 --> 01:47:59.840
Quiet. Keep your voice down.

01:48:07.100 --> 01:48:11.150
What are those two doing?
I'll have to leave them behind.

01:48:13.020 --> 01:48:15.650
I advise you not to anger me.

01:48:18.320 --> 01:48:21.160
We'll be alone here for a long time.

01:48:27.500 --> 01:48:29.000
They should've escaped.

01:48:33.670 --> 01:48:35.500
You think you can fight me?

01:49:04.200 --> 01:49:05.370
Robots!

01:49:41.740 --> 01:49:43.110
Sheeta!

01:49:51.910 --> 01:49:53.080
Fantastic!

01:49:53.960 --> 01:49:56.210
A marvelous display, no?

01:49:58.800 --> 01:50:01.260
Die, you insects!

01:50:03.880 --> 01:50:04.930
How dare you!

01:50:08.890 --> 01:50:10.140
Damn.

01:50:17.940 --> 01:50:20.480
Be a good girl, give it back.

01:50:21.690 --> 01:50:24.200
Please, open!

01:50:32.790 --> 01:50:34.660
Just where will you go?

01:50:36.790 --> 01:50:38.130
Open!

01:50:57.230 --> 01:50:58.560
Sheeta!

01:51:13.330 --> 01:51:15.160
Sheeta!

01:51:15.580 --> 01:51:18.500
Pazu!

01:51:18.790 --> 01:51:20.500
Sheeta!

01:51:22.000 --> 01:51:23.760
-Pazu!
-Sheeta!

01:51:25.670 --> 01:51:26.630
Sheeta!

01:51:27.470 --> 01:51:28.890
-Pazu!
-Sheeta!

01:51:29.180 --> 01:51:31.430
I'm coming. Damn.

01:51:31.510 --> 01:51:32.470
Get back!

01:51:33.100 --> 01:51:36.310
Take this, hurry! Muska's coming, quick!

01:51:44.360 --> 01:51:46.070
Throw it into the sea.

01:51:49.160 --> 01:51:50.030
Sheeta!

01:51:52.950 --> 01:51:56.870
Hold onto that stone.
I'll trade her life for it.

01:52:25.900 --> 01:52:28.610
Get up! No more hide and seek.

01:52:35.540 --> 01:52:38.500
How delightful that it should end
in the throne room.

01:52:38.870 --> 01:52:39.750
Come here!

01:52:40.250 --> 01:52:41.880
The throne room?

01:52:42.210 --> 01:52:44.250
This will be our grave.

01:52:45.920 --> 01:52:49.590
What is a king
when his country lies ruined?

01:52:50.010 --> 01:52:51.510
I won't give you the stone.

01:52:52.090 --> 01:52:55.310
You'll die, trapped here with me.
There's no escape.

01:52:56.430 --> 01:53:00.270
This is why Laputa died out.

01:53:01.190 --> 01:53:03.020
There's a song in my valley...

01:53:04.310 --> 01:53:07.780
<i>Put down your roots in the soil</i>
<i>Live together with the wind</i>

01:53:07.860 --> 01:53:11.740
<i>Pass the winter with the seeds</i>
<i>Sing in the spring with the birds</i>

01:53:12.950 --> 01:53:15.030
Your weapons may be powerful.

01:53:15.530 --> 01:53:18.160
Your pitiful robots may be numerous.

01:53:18.240 --> 01:53:20.120
But you can't survive
away from the earth.

01:53:24.830 --> 01:53:27.750
Laputa will not die. It will rise again.

01:53:28.550 --> 01:53:31.050
Its power is the stuff
of humanity's dreams.

01:53:33.720 --> 01:53:37.100
Next, I shoot off your ears!

01:53:37.260 --> 01:53:38.600
Beg for your life.

01:53:39.020 --> 01:53:41.100
Make the kid hand over the stone.

01:53:42.140 --> 01:53:43.770
Wait!

01:53:44.480 --> 01:53:45.730
The stone's hidden.

01:53:45.810 --> 01:53:48.320
You can shoot, but you won't get it.

01:53:48.940 --> 01:53:52.990
Stay away, Pazu. He'll kill us both.

01:53:53.660 --> 01:53:57.620
I'll spare her life if you tell me
where the stone is.

01:53:58.830 --> 01:54:02.790
Or do you intend to conquer me
with that cannon of yours?

01:54:05.080 --> 01:54:06.960
Let me talk to Sheeta alone.

01:54:07.250 --> 01:54:09.710
Run away. Take the stone and run!

01:54:11.420 --> 01:54:13.090
Three minutes.

01:54:29.270 --> 01:54:30.480
Pazu.

01:54:35.360 --> 01:54:37.700
Sheeta, calm down and listen.

01:54:38.490 --> 01:54:39.950
Teach me that spell.

01:54:42.200 --> 01:54:43.540
I'll say it with you.

01:54:44.710 --> 01:54:46.540
Put your hand in mine.

01:54:56.550 --> 01:54:58.550
I cut the pirates' ropes.

01:55:03.560 --> 01:55:05.350
Time's up. What do you say?

01:55:48.690 --> 01:55:51.650
My eyes! My eyes!

01:55:57.240 --> 01:55:58.570
I can't see...

01:56:12.460 --> 01:56:14.300
Mama, it's collapsing!

01:56:14.380 --> 01:56:16.300
All right, let's go. Hurry!

01:56:16.590 --> 01:56:17.720
Hurry!

01:56:29.310 --> 01:56:31.810
Look, the bottom's falling out!

01:57:22.610 --> 01:57:24.820
Sheeta was such a nice girl...

01:57:25.870 --> 01:57:27.790
They used the spell of destruction.

01:57:28.660 --> 01:57:31.910
Those kids saved Laputa from those idiots.

01:57:35.380 --> 01:57:36.880
It's stopping!

01:57:43.260 --> 01:57:46.390
A crystal! A humongous one!

01:57:46.720 --> 01:57:48.060
It's rising.

01:57:54.560 --> 01:57:58.570
The tree... it's carrying it away.
Chase it!

01:57:58.860 --> 01:58:00.990
You're heavy, get off.

01:58:01.070 --> 01:58:02.070
I can't!

01:58:33.520 --> 01:58:34.600
Sheeta!

01:58:39.190 --> 01:58:40.110
Pazu...

01:58:45.280 --> 01:58:47.620
The roots protected us.

01:59:04.130 --> 01:59:05.380
We can still use this.

01:59:06.220 --> 01:59:07.300
Here goes.

02:00:17.290 --> 02:00:20.420
What are you doing, we're not moving.

02:00:20.500 --> 02:00:23.500
Of course not, we're overloaded.

02:00:28.220 --> 02:00:30.640
It's Sheeta!

02:00:30.720 --> 02:00:31.550
She's alive!

02:00:31.640 --> 02:00:32.510
It's the kid!

02:00:36.930 --> 02:00:37.980
Dola!

02:00:38.520 --> 02:00:39.810
Thank God you're alive!

02:00:40.520 --> 02:00:41.810
You guys okay?

02:00:42.230 --> 02:00:46.150
Oh, no! My galleon's wrecked...

02:00:47.400 --> 02:00:50.910
Oh, stop blubbering.
We'll build a better ship!

02:00:51.530 --> 02:00:55.910
You poor child, the worst
is having your hair hacked off...

02:00:56.660 --> 02:00:58.620
-I can't breathe!
-Sorry.

02:01:00.330 --> 02:01:01.330
Pathetic.

02:01:02.210 --> 02:01:04.170
All that work, and only this to show.

02:01:07.380 --> 02:01:09.590
We ran out of time!
